DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
2310::$$$message_0013_0000_0000$$$::"Hey Tohsaka. I want to ask you something."[lr]::
2311::$$$message_0013_0000_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
2312::$$$message_0013_0000_0002$$$::I hear what sounds like a reply, but I can't quite make it out.::
2313::$$$message_0013_0001_0000$$$::"Sorry, I couldn't hear you."[lr]::
2314::$$$message_0013_0001_0001$$$::"Oh, please! It's unlocked."[lr]::
2315::$$$message_0013_0001_0002$$$::She raises her voice, and it sounds angry.::
2316::$$$message_0013_0002_0000$$$::Tohsaka doesn't seem to be in a good mood.[lr]::
2317::$$$message_0013_0002_0001$$$::Is it really okay for me to open this door, then?[lr]::
2318::$$$message_0013_0002_0002$$$::Still, it can't be worse than running away after calling out to her.::
2319::$$$message_0013_0003_0000$$$::"[shock vmax=10 time=300 count=-3]Whoa, what the? When did you make such a mess?"[lr]::
2320::$$$message_0013_0003_0001$$$::Tohsaka's belongings are strewn all over the floor of her room. [lr]::
2321::$$$message_0013_0003_0002$$$::I wouldn't have expected it to get this disorderly in the few days she's been home.::
2322::$$$message_0013_0004_0000$$$::"Is that all you came to say to me?"[lr]::
2323::$$$message_0013_0004_0001$$$::She glares at me, daring me to say more. She's in a [font italic=true]really[font italic=false] bad mood.[lr]::
2324::$$$message_0013_0004_0002$$$::"No, that's not why I'm here."::
2325::$$$message_0013_0005_0000$$$::"Then what do you want? As you can see, I'm really busy cleaning up."::
2326::$$$message_0013_0006_0000$$$::"...Cleaning?"::
2327::$$$message_0013_0007_0000$$$::"...And what's that supposed to mean, Emiya?"[lr]::
2328::$$$message_0013_0007_0001$$$::Crap, I said that aloud.[lr]::
2329::$$$message_0013_0007_0002$$$::The red devil smirks at me, having shed the skin of Rin Tohsaka the honor student.::
2330::$$$message_0013_0008_0000$$$::"Um, never mind.[cacheimage storage=凛私服05b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服05b(中) textoff=0] I just had something quick to ask you."[lr]::
2331::$$$message_0013_0008_0001$$$::"Okay. Then can it wait?"[lr]::
2332::$$$message_0013_0008_0002$$$::"Yeah. Sorry for interrupting you."[lr]::
2333::$$$message_0013_0008_0003$$$::I back away slowly without breaking eye contact, and close the door.::
2334::$$$message_0013_0009_0000$$$::"Man..."[lr]::
2335::$$$message_0013_0009_0001$$$::Both making a mess that big in the name of cleaning, and actually cleaning a mess that big takes talent.::
902319::$$$message_9013_0003_0000$$$::"Whoa, what the? When did you make such a mess?"[r]::

